### CodeReview AI — API Examples
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### =========== AUTH ===========

### Register
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fabrício Júnio",
  "email": "fabricio@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fabricio@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### =========== REVIEWS ===========

### Submit Java code for review
# @name submitJava
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "java",
  "sourceCode": "public class UserService {\n    private List<User> users = new ArrayList<>();\n\n    public User getUser(int id) {\n        for (User u : users) {\n            if (u.getId() == id) return u;\n        }\n        return null;\n    }\n\n    public void saveUser(User user) {\n        users.add(user);\n        System.out.println(\"User saved: \" + user);\n        // TODO: persist to DB\n    }\n}",
  "filename": "UserService.java"
}

### Submit Python code for review
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "python",
  "sourceCode": "def calculate_total(items=[]):\n    total = 0\n    for i in range(len(items)):\n        total = total + items[i]['price']\n    return total\n\ndef get_user(id):\n    import requests\n    r = requests.get('http://api.example.com/users/' + id)\n    return r.json()",
  "filename": "calculator.py"
}

### Submit JavaScript code for review
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "javascript",
  "sourceCode": "function fetchData(url, callback) {\n  fetch(url)\n    .then(res => res.json())\n    .then(data => {\n      processData(data, function(result) {\n        saveResult(result, function(saved) {\n          callback(saved);\n        });\n      });\n    });\n}",
  "filename": "api.js"
}

### Submit from GitHub URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews/github
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/fabriciojunio/codereview-ai/blob/main/examples/SampleService.java"
}

### =========== RESULTS ===========

### Get result by ticket ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews/{{submitJava.response.body.ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get review history (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews/history?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Stream analysis via SSE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reviews/{{submitJava.response.body.ticketId}}/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### =========== HEALTH ===========

### Actuator health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### Ping
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ping
